{"name":"Prism Music","dev":"Prologue Audio Pty Ltd","keys":["ios:1335007451"],"ios":{"id":"1335007451","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/prism-music/id1335007451?uo=4","rating":4.64499,"ratings":738,"price":"Free","genre":"Music","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource124/v4/b3/32/19/b33219f8-bc5d-f17c-9982-022fa6075fda/05de46f1-1d89-43ac-90f5-f78352948749_iPhone_7_Plus-screenshot_01_player.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource124/v4/05/80/20/05802073-9cb6-acd2-ab0b-12c42424cde5/49644375-f601-405f-b9cf-928acf1caf88_iPhone_7_Plus-screenshot_02_libraries.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/dd/be/e3/ddbee38b-7501-fc33-4365-9bd871d70fc0/1fa76874-a871-47d4-8687-202247e36b60_iPhone_7_Plus-screenshot_03_filters.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/d9/fc/34/d9fc3439-ff4f-57db-5754-3398add4e57b/b7488a0b-7ec1-4fd4-bc02-04c3c5a18451_iPhone_7_Plus-screenshot_04_arrange.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/91/cf/bb/91cfbb74-47e1-4945-8c9f-cf231cbd2fc6/86160f07-7d12-4e4e-9b82-59742ac7da04_iPhone_7_Plus-screenshot_05_list.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/2a/be/18/2abe1831-847d-67b5-815f-ecdd69794183/75468dcc-56fe-4b7f-94ed-9a95799e35f2_iPhone_7_Plus-screenshot_06_equalizer.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/a4/d9/bc/a4d9bc3b-ca64-bd7c-8b44-09f29cd6f3a6/82ff91ed-ba7a-467c-b109-72fe28bcb1aa_iPhone_7_Plus-screenshot_07_theme.png/392x696bb.png"],"desc":"Prism is a versatile music player for Plex and Apple Music.\n\nFEATURES\n- Access music already on your device or in your iCloud Music Library*, or add a free Plex account to stream your music from anywhere in the world.\n- Refine your library by adding one or more filters\n- Various options for sorting and displaying your library\n- 7-band equalizer\n- CarPlay support\n\nPayment required to unlock additional features:\n- Download music from your Plex server to play later without an internet connection\n- Automatically switch between light and dark themes\n- Configure default sorting for libraries, artists and albums\n- Import playlists from iTunes and Plex libraries\n\n* The built-in iOS music app must be installed for local or iCloud Music Library support","released":"2018-08-31","updated":"2022-02-15","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/2a/4e/6b/2a4e6b3a-b03e-d4d7-afff-fb1a487b4eab/AppIcon-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/2a/4e/6b/2a4e6b3a-b03e-d4d7-afff-fb1a487b4eab/AppIcon-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Music & Audio","rating":4.64,"ratings":738,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":0,"hn_comments":0,"submissions":0,"self_n":0,"hn_score":2.0,"first":1680785343,"last":1680785343,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":1,"pos_pct":100,"neg_pct":0,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":35467649,"k":"ios:1335007451","type":"comment","by":"adamtrainer","time":1680785343,"text":"For playing a Plex library on iOS, I recommend Prism (https://apps.apple.com/us/app/prism-music/id1335007451).","title":null,"story_id":35461596,"story_title":"I don't want streaming music, I just want to stream my music","story_score":537,"comments":0,"w":1.0,"u":0,"s":"pos","self":false}],"slug":"prism-music"}